# wide.sm -- A wide thin plate with holes, no bends, the size of a guard
# Copyright (c) 2026 Jakob Kastelic

# Its top and front views at scale 1 fit a B sheet only beside the
# notes and under the revision table.
sheet 0.43 1 0.5
plate p 0 0 265 86 at 0 0 0 axes +x +y
hole hole1 3.5 10 5 along z pattern x 2 230 y 2 76
hole hole2 10 10 25 along z pattern x 2 230
